{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06626","headline":"京口题崇上人山亭 · 储光羲","name":"京口题崇上人山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清旦历香岩，岩径纡复直。\n花林开宿雾，游目清霄极。\n分明窗户中，远近山川色。\n金沙童子戏，香饭诸天食。\n呌呌海鸿声，轩轩江燕翼。\n寄言清静者，闾阎徒自踣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}